{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787095241609744002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"insincere-illogical-antlion","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"d82f9c007f11befe62715ba4d53b28aa0a189c55fa5e8d6f8b80867dd5b2aada","event_uuid":"d525ecef-2525-4c3d-8103-409d641b9482","position":{"commit_sha":"65ccbc9c08b4b18577851be2cf977030c6bb8132","position":"1787095104408880001-d525ecef-2525-4c3d-8103-409d641b9482"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"b529d944ea43f99e04da32b3acd34a76e04bde57dc853656fee03b1debc46ccc","event_uuid":"2e376995-dce8-47ca-9ef6-ab41147eb017","position":{"commit_sha":"92153e4c00dfacf9cc1ba23855ea1b450d2fc4f1","position":"1787095152976842001-2e376995-dce8-47ca-9ef6-ab41147eb017"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"77d6f600177ea109dca87ed0c9895c60bdb7b46a0fdcb893de2aa03ae227ec62","event_uuid":"390d0b60-405f-4b4d-840b-3b15120b65e4","position":{"commit_sha":"d6c72d4c387903b8522cf49a54ccc669a521cf8c","position":"1787095241609744001-390d0b60-405f-4b4d-840b-3b15120b65e4"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787095104408880001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## Context / Problem\nSlice C1 (ticket 29a9-3cf7-3ded-42d8) recorded 57 below-seam ambient config/credential reads in the reconciler engine (_engine/rebar_reconciler + _engine_support) as entries in `scripts/config_ownership_exceptions.LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS`. RP-04 is not complete while these ambient reads sit below the approved composition/credential/backend seams enforced by `scripts/check_config_ownership.py`. Parent: 075b-1479-dcb7-40ab.\n\nAffected files (relative to `src/rebar/`):\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/__main__.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/_advisory_lock.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/_preflight.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/access_check.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira/acli_subprocess.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira/outbound_fields.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira_datacenter/settings.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira_family/rich_text.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira_family/wiki_render.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/applier.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/apply_handlers.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/apply_inbound.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/apply_inbound_records.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/apply_planning.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/binding_store.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/binding_walk.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/dispatch_one.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/fetcher.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/inbound_differ.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/inbound_translate.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/invariants.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/last_pass.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/outbound_comments.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/outbound_differ.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/pass_io.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/rebar_id_audit.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/reconcile.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/reconcile_check.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/reconcile_helpers.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/request.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/run_differs.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine_support/bridge_fsck_visibility.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine_support/gates.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine_support/lookups.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_engine_support/reads.py`\n\n## Outcome\nEvery below-seam read in the files above is either (a) CUT to compose through the approved seam that already assembles config — the operation snapshot (`rebar._operation_config.OperationSnapshot` / `compose_operation_snapshot`), a startup binding, or the provider-credential boundary — or (b) REGISTERED as an owned, non-legacy entry with an exact `path`+`symbol`+`rationale` for genuine test-only controls and protocol constants. Their `LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS` entries are removed. `python scripts/check_config_ownership.py` reports zero findings for these paths with those entries gone and no path-glob exception. The subsystem's behavioral suites stay green; redacted operation-snapshot fingerprints / provider-neutral outcomes are unchanged except recorded, justified deltas.\n\n## Plan\n1. For each below-seam read in the listed files, classify as cut-to-seam or register-owned; for cut-to-seam, thread the value from the composition seam rather than reading ambient `os.environ`/`os.getenv`/`load_config` below it.\n2. Remove the corresponding entries for these files from `LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS` in `scripts/config_ownership_exceptions.py`.\n3. Run `python scripts/check_config_ownership.py` and the subsystem behavioral suites (tests/interfaces/store, tests/integration reconciler suites, tests/unit/rebar_reconciler); keep green.\n\n## Testing (RED -> GREEN)\n- Held-out test `tests/scripts/test_reconciler_engine_seam_clean_heldout.py` asserts `check_config_ownership.check(check_config_ownership.REPO_ROOT)` returns no finding string containing any of the listed paths, AND that `config_ownership_exceptions.LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS` contains zero entries whose `path` is one of the listed files. RED now (entries present + reads below seam).\n- The subsystem behavioral suites (tests/interfaces/store, tests/integration reconciler suites, tests/unit/rebar_reconciler) stay green after the cutover — they are the correctness oracle the AST gate supplements.\n- Redacted operation-snapshot fingerprints before/after are equal except recorded deltas.\n\n## Compatibility / rollback\nNo stored ticket/event/binding format changes. A legacy facade is removed only after its focused suite passes; until then rollback selects the facade.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] No direct ambient config/credential read, backend reload, or configurable default remains below the approved seam in the 35 listed files; each is cut-to-seam or registered as an owned (non-legacy) entry with rationale.\n- [ ] The `LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS` entries for these files are removed from `scripts/config_ownership_exceptions.py`, and `python scripts/check_config_ownership.py` passes with no path-glob exception (proven by the held-out `test_reconciler_engine_seam_clean_heldout.py`).\n- [ ] The subsystem behavioral suites (tests/interfaces/store, tests/integration reconciler suites, tests/unit/rebar_reconciler) pass after the cutover; redacted operation-snapshot fingerprints / provider-neutral outcomes are unchanged except recorded approved deltas.\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impa